window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She killed his brother now he wants revenge.</p> <p>Will the vampire rip her heart out or give her his?</p> <p>Sage: Born into the secret organization Venom, my only mission was to help eradicate the virus that turns humans into vampires. My first night in the field I killed a bloodsucker, causing his vengeful brother to stalk me, arrogantly playing with his food before the final kill.</p> <p>Being terrorized by Luka was stressful enough, but when information about my organization is revealed, I struggle with my own moral code. With help from him and some other supernatural enemies, we begin to uncover secrets my society is hiding.</p> <p>But Venom isn’t the only one concealing something. My attraction toward Luka is like no other, the sensual feelings terrifying me to the core.</p> <p>Luka: Watching a hunter plunge a stake into my brother’s heart left me heartbroken . . . and murderous. My newfound obsession is to terrorize her until I’m ready to make the kill.</p> <p>When information about my other brother’s abduction is discovered, my blind need for revenge halts. To expose Venom’s true agenda, and hopefully find him alive, I must join forces with the enemy. Sage is brazen, judgmental, and annoying, constantly testing my patience.</p> <p>But the mind-blowing scent of her sweet lust makes it impossible to work with her. It’s beyond magical, leaving me infatuated, ready to sink my fangs into her.</p> <p>The Argentium Vampire Hunters Trilogy is an 18+ Paranormal Romance set in present time with a two character, 1st person multi-point of view.</p> <p>THIS BOOK ENDS ON A CLIFFHANGER.</p>"; 
